  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/yTUtjmE1DsSnimWZOBZ42gQOyQnG1jgS7ns0bOAppBp6MVlpStX9JLGbJvLqfjCiLHTOL9T4sdOhCp5I0Bor4UhoKy4O45Vr3FY7pdi0pNcmHav8jugFoZHF9xILa79CztvDjMLLnn4lRvPx5sMCN7OU4foHmWpViTkWxdHwdrB3CYTiziLwsPQw7ihTVYGsNxZxxS8f\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/260/99cfb7745d43fd5be4296a9c46e93700..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こんにちは！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日は美容室に行ってきたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">触覚を太くしたんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あまり似合ってる気がしないわね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも久しぶりに縮毛して気分が上がっています</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ᴖ_ᴖ✨</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">早くみんなに会いたいねえ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">明日会えるね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">久しぶりの6周ですので</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">長くみんなと話せるんじゃないかな～と思いまつ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とらいさんの周年みんなでお祝いしよね！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">見習い服着るらしい、おそろいだあ～ﾄﾞｷ(✱°⌂°✱)ﾄﾞｷ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/ADxs0enZuO598o4wtvgns0OscQ5JTjtf8ckShAJbY8OeeSgKMHjje92GnCnmr0XMAbI1hI0HSRaTuuzyemHoaHfsKq1r8QRJTyahTt7wrXwxU99XuyeojRp9kHvb1LsUKGFpJayimARYwJqXDaLDMU9whW0FIEqXgrupbtTjxTT17L5X8985U04Gnsocujs33zWKw9Xi\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/260/fe560f6a1c66261f75e916cd074b8d33..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">さっき食べた美味しいうどんです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ではおやすみ</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
